msgstr "Palun oota, kuni installimine lõpeb"

msgid "makepkg cannot run as root; run debtap-mod as a regular user."
msgstr "makepkg ei saa root-kasutajana töötada; käivita debtap-mod tavakasutajana."

msgid "makepkg failed with exit code {code}"
msgstr "makepkg ebaõnnestus väljumiskoodiga {code}"

msgid "makepkg finished but produced no package"
msgstr "makepkg lõpetas, kuid ei loonud ühtegi paketti"

msgid "“{typed}” only refreshes the package list. Here the safe equivalent checks for updates without installing anything; to install them use “{upgrade}”."
msgstr "“{typed}” värskendab ainult paketiloendit. Siin kontrollib turvaline vaste uuendusi, installimata midagi; nende paigaldamiseks kasuta “{upgrade}”."

msgid "Never run “pacman -Sy” alone: refreshing without upgrading can break the system."
msgstr "Ära kunagi käivita ainult “pacman -Sy”: loendi värskendamine ilma süsteemi uuendamata võib süsteemi rikkuda."

msgid "Arch does not upgrade single packages; the whole system is upgraded together."
msgstr "Arch ei uuenda üksikuid pakette; kogu süsteemi uuendatakse korraga."

msgid "Tell which package to install, for example: {example}"
msgstr "Ütle, milline pakett paigaldada, näiteks: {example}"

msgid ".rpm packages are made for Fedora/openSUSE and cannot be installed here."
msgstr ".rpm-paketid on mõeldud Fedorale/openSUSE-le ja neid ei saa siia paigaldada."

msgid "Look for the program in the repositories (pamac search), on Flathub, or as an AppImage."
msgstr "Otsi programmi hoidlatest (pamac search), Flathubist või AppImage'ina."

msgid "pamac also finds programs in the AUR and Flatpak: {cmd}"
msgstr "pamac leiab programme ka AUR-ist ja Flatpakist: {cmd}"

msgid ".deb packages are converted into native pacman packages by debtap-mod."
msgstr "debtap-mod teisendab .deb-paketid natiivseteks pacmani pakettideks."

msgid "Run this command as a regular user (without sudo)."
msgstr "Käivita see käsk tavakasutajana (ilma sudota)."

msgid "Tell which package to remove, for example: {example}"
msgstr "Ütle, milline pakett eemaldada, näiteks: {example}"

msgid "-n also deletes the configuration files the package installed in /etc."
msgstr "-n kustutab ka seadistusfailid, mille pakett kausta /etc paigaldas."

msgid "There are no orphan packages to remove."
msgstr "Eemaldatavaid orbpakette pole."

msgid "Tell what to search for, for example: {example}"
msgstr "Ütle, mida otsida, näiteks: {example}"

msgid "Tell which package, for example: {example}"
msgstr "Ütle, milline pakett, näiteks: {example}"

msgid "The package is not installed; the list comes from the repository file database."
msgstr "Pakett pole paigaldatud; loend pärineb hoidla failide andmebaasist."

msgid "Tell which file, for example: {example}"
msgstr "Ütle, milline fail, näiteks: {example}"

msgid "The file is not on this system; searching the repository file database."
msgstr "Faili pole selles süsteemis; otsin hoidla failide andmebaasist."

msgid "Arch-based systems have no PPAs or extra repositories to add. Programs from the community come from the AUR."
msgstr "Archil põhinevatel süsteemidel pole lisatavaid PPA-sid ega lisahoidlaid. Kogukonna programmid tulevad AUR-ist."

msgid "Search with “pamac search --aur <name>” and install with “pamac build <name>”."
msgstr "Otsi käsuga “pamac search --aur <name>” ja paigalda käsuga “pamac build <name>”."

msgid "To keep a package from being upgraded, add it to IgnorePkg in /etc/pacman.conf."
msgstr "Et paketti ei uuendataks, lisa see faili /etc/pacman.conf valikusse IgnorePkg."

msgid "“{command}” has no direct equivalent here."
msgstr "Käsul “{command}” pole siin otsest vastet."

msgid "Run “{tool} help” to see the commands this system understands."
msgstr "Käivita “{tool} help”, et näha käske, mida see süsteem mõistab."

msgid "Tell which .deb file to install, for example: {example}"
msgstr "Ütle, milline .deb-fail paigaldada, näiteks: {example}"

msgid "This system uses pacman, not {tool}."
msgstr "See süsteem kasutab pacmani, mitte {tool}."

